    "method": "Window screenshots and accessibility-tree text captured through the host desktop session; window titles are OS-drawn and stay readable when GPU drawing is unavailable."
  },
  "runs": [
    {
      "id": "upload",
      "binary": "image_upload.exe",
      "argv": [
        "--fixture"
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "action": "Load current revision",
          "observed": "image painted; native generation 1; 16/16 tiles in the composed scene",
          "capture": "captures/01-upload-generation-1-painted.png"
        },
        {
          "action": "Backend: Recreate",
          "observed": "window title \"MP-IMG3 Fixture upload feasibility — GPU復旧中\"; generation advanced",
          "capture": "captures/02-upload-recovering.png"
        },
        {
          "action": "Load current revision (after recovery)",
          "observed": "native generation 2; image painted again; no stale picture was kept during the transition",
          "capture": "captures/03-upload-generation-2-painted.png"
        },
        {
          "action": "Backend: Fail",
          "observed": "window title \"… — GPU表示不可: アプリを再起動してください\"; client area drawn black; window still accepted input",
          "capture": "captures/04-upload-unavailable.png"
        },
        {
          "action": "Backend: Recreate then Load current revision",
          "observed": "native generation 4 Ready; this probe retains no backup, so its next load was refused with \"Fixture unavailable: RetainedFrameLimit\" after the quarantine ledger filled",
          "capture": "captures/05-upload-recovered-generation-3-painted.png"
        }
      ],
      "limitations": "The probe keeps no recovery backup and paints every transfer, so its own re-admission is charged each time; the refusal is the explicit ledger state, not a stale picture."
    },
    {
      "id": "viewer",
      "binary": "image_viewer.exe",
      "argv": [
        "--fixture"
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "action": "zoom to 37.4%",
          "observed": "physical display scale 37.4%, cropped region",
          "capture": "captures/06-viewer-zoomed-before-recovery.png"
        },
        {
          "action": "Backend: Recreate",
          "observed": "title \"MP-IMG5 Local Fixture Viewer — GPU復旧中\" during the transition",
          "capture": null
        },
        {
          "action": "after recovery",
          "observed": "same 37.4% camera and the same crop restored; decoder count did not grow (retained CPU pixels were re-bound)",
          "capture": "captures/07-viewer-restored-after-recovery.png"
        }
      ],
      "limitations": "One transition observed in this run; repeated transitions are bounded by the 32 MiB quarantine ledger (MP-REC2)."
    },
    {
      "id": "compare-two-windows",
      "binary": "compare.exe",
      "argv": [
        "--fixture",
        "--windows2"
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "action": "initial",
          "observed": "both windows render A/B panes at 23.2%",
          "capture": "captures/08-compare-window1-before-recovery.png, captures/09-compare-window2-before-recovery.png"
        },
        {
          "action": "Backend: Recreate in window 1",
          "observed": "both windows reported \"GPU復旧中\" for the same generation, proving one shared platform generation",
          "capture": null
        },
        {
          "action": "after recovery",
          "observed": "both windows restored A/B at 23.2%",
          "capture": "captures/10-compare-window1-after-recovery.png, captures/11-compare-window2-after-recovery.png"
        },
        {
          "action": "Backend: Fail in window 1",
          "observed": "both windows reported \"GPU表示不可: アプリを再起動してください\"; input still accepted",
          "capture": "captures/12-compare-unavailable.png"
        },
        {
          "action": "Backend: Recreate then observe",
          "observed": "panes reported \"画像を利用できません: 保持上限に達したため、この画像を保持できません。\" with diagnostics retained_frames=0 consumers=0 cpu=35782656 B packed=2228224 B: the unproven-transfer ledger was full, so no unsafe release happened",
          "capture": "captures/13-compare-after-failure-recreate.png"
        }
      ],
      "limitations": "Two windows x repeated transitions exhaust the 32 MiB quarantine ledger. The refusal is explicit and no stale picture is shown; plateau/release accounting belongs to MP-REC2."
    }
  ],
  "observations": [
    "Recovering is reported before device teardown and Ready only after the shared device, text resources and every window renderer were rebuilt.",
    "A controlled recreation failure leaves the message loop responsive and states the restart requirement in the native window title even though GPU drawing is unavailable.",
    "No stale picture was published after any transition; panes that could not re-admit stated the reason instead.",
    "Compare with two windows observed one shared generation, not a per-window counter."
  ],
  "not_measured": [
    "Actual OS GPU/driver reset: HOLD (the hooks rebuild backend resources only).",
